<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">28</td>\n</tr><tr style=\"background:#f0c4c4;\"> <td>13</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/IFK_Norrk%C3%B6ping\" title=\"IFK Norrköping\">IFK Norrköping</a>                            </td>\n<td>26</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>11</td>\n<td>37</td>\n<td>40</td>\n<td>−3</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">27</td>\n</tr><tr style=\"background:#f0c4c4;\"> <td>14</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kalmar_FF\" title=\"Kalmar FF\">Kalmar FF</a> <span style=\"cursor:help;color:dimgrey;font-size:0.8em;font-weight:bold;\" title=\"Uppflyttad från föregående säsong\">(U)</span>                         </td>\n<td>26</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>14</td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>40</td>\n<td>−20</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">24</td>\n</tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Resultattabell\">Resultattabell</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_2002&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Resultattabell\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_2002&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Resultattabell\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>&#160;<span class=\"noprint plainlinks\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:normal; font-size:80%; ;\">Denna tabell:&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Mall:Resultattabell_f%C3%B6r_Fotbollsallsvenskan_2002\" title=\"Mall:Resultattabell för Fotbollsallsvenskan 2002\"><span title=\"Visa denna mall\" style=\";\">visa</span></a>&#160;<span style=\"font-size:80%;\">•</span>&#160;<a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//sv.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Mall:Resultattabell_f%C3%B6r_Fotbollsallsvenskan_2002&amp;action=edit\